# What

* Learning Outcomes
- How to plan and execute ML research
- Explain the theoretical foundations behind statistical learning approaches
- Understand Bayesian vs. frequentist perspectives
- Knowledge Representation in AI and ML
- Bayesian ML (theory and practice)
- Causal inference
- Learn tools (PyMC, etc)

* Syllabus
- [Syllabus](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YXCrqh6KGg3xm4-Lr4QGdBnjeWEfkqz67FHNHB_rdAk)
  - Techniques: Practical machine learning
  - Knowledge representation
  - Statistical learning theory
  - Bayesian statistics
  - Probabilistic Programming
  - Causal inference
  - Bayesian statistics over time

